  "rulings": [
    {
      "comment": "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\u2019t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus\u2014an object either is historic or it isn\u2019t.",
      "oracle_id": "36282c29-a44b-4156-9441-03aa4bf386a8",
      "published_at": "2018-04-27",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "You choose the artifact card on resolution.",
      "oracle_id": "4fd6d9af-4d53-4e10-bc23-672454803099",
      "published_at": "2004-10-04",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.",
      "oracle_id": "4fd6d9af-4d53-4e10-bc23-672454803099",
      "published_at": "2007-05-01",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Chulane's triggered ability doesn't count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you've already played your land for the turn, and even if it's not your turn.",
      "oracle_id": "ebf7ce9b-9e5e-4557-9e28-76556997f0ee",
      "published_at": "2019-10-04",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Chulane's triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.",
      "oracle_id": "ebf7ce9b-9e5e-4557-9e28-76556997f0ee",
      "published_at": "2019-10-04",
      "source": "wotc"
    }
  ],
